---
/**
 * /agb — terms and conditions for orders placed through the shop. Drafted
 * against how the shop actually works (drops, QR-bill payment by bank
 * transfer, pickup-only at ATTAKK HQ, no shipping) rather than boilerplate;
 * still a draft per the plan doc, so have someone read it before launch. The
 * one bracketed item (the payment deadline) is an open decision, not a
 * placeholder with a fixed default.
 */
import LegalLayout from "@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Terms and conditions"
  description="Terms and conditions for orders placed at atk-collective.ch."
  heading="Terms and conditions"
  updated="September 2026"
>
  <h2>Scope</h2>
  <p>
    These terms apply to every order placed through atk-collective.ch. Placing
    an order means you accept them.
  </p>

  <h2>Products and drops</h2>
  <p>
    Pieces are released in limited drops. A live drop's pieces are made to order
    once the drop closes; an archived drop is shown for reference only and
    cannot be ordered. Colours and fabrics may vary slightly from the photos.
  </p>

  <h2>Prices and payment</h2>
  <p>
    All prices are shown in Swiss francs (CHF) and include Swiss VAT where
    applicable. Payment is by bank transfer against the Swiss QR-bill sent with
    your order confirmation, referencing the order's own reference number.
    [Payment is due within — decide a deadline, e.g. 14 or 30 days, or leave
    open until the order is cancelled by hand.] An order is confirmed once
    payment is received.
  </p>

  <h2>Delivery</h2>
  <p>
    Pieces are made on demand. They're ready for pickup at ATTAKK HQ in roughly
    6–10 weeks from your order; we'll email you when yours is ready to collect.
    We don't ship — collection at ATTAKK HQ is the only option today.
  </p>

  <h2>Returns and exchanges</h2>
  <p>
    Swiss law does not require a right of withdrawal for online purchases.
    Made-to-order pieces are final sale. If something arrives faulty or the
    wrong size, contact us at hello@atk-collective.ch and we'll sort out a
    repair, replacement or refund.
  </p>

  <h2>Liability</h2>
  <p>
    ATTAKK's liability is limited to the price paid for the order, except where
    liability cannot be limited by law.
  </p>

  <h2>Applicable law and jurisdiction</h2>
  <p>
    These terms are governed by Swiss law. The courts of Zürich have
    jurisdiction, subject to any mandatory consumer-protection rule that says
    otherwise.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
